+# TRIPWIRE R3 (branch spike/r3-sram, D-031): copied verbatim, below this block, from the Loom entry,
+# github.com/thomasgilbert481/tt_um_loom, branch sram-smoke, commit c7000671ca8eb239a2a719dfc4b93a6c9962b48e,
+# src/pdn_cfg.tcl (Apache-2.0; its own copyright and licence header follows). Its geometry assumes
+# the macro at x = 12 (+ k x 67.44) with the FP_PDN_V* keys in src/config.json. "loom_" names kept.
